  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/EntradaMatutinaTales1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) El pas de l&#39;etapa de la Volta Ciclista a Espanya d&#39;aquest dijous per Tales ha obligat a avan&ccedil;ar l&#39;entrada de bous i vaques, que normalment es fa a les 14 hores, per&ograve; aquesta vegada ha sigut a l&#39;inusual horari de les 9 del mat&iacute;,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/ProvaMatutinaTales1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>amb la prova corresponent, a continuaci&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3678.jpg\" alt=\"img_3678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3682.jpg\" alt=\"img_3682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3684.jpg\" alt=\"img_3684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3689.jpg\" alt=\"img_3689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3690.jpg\" alt=\"img_3690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3691.jpg\" alt=\"img_3691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3695.jpg\" alt=\"img_3695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tales17encierro/img_3697.jpg\" alt=\"img_3697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d